Description:It is your first main phase. You have Bloodbraid Elf (3/2 haste, cascade) in hand with {R}{R}{G}{G} floating. Your library is Colossal Dreadmaw, Lightning Bolt, Colossal Dreadmaw. The opponent is at 6 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
